// Reviewer correction: an earlier version used GroundAoe's `pooled_debuff`
// for an instant, non-lingering burst, reasoning no persistent-zone
// primitive existed. One does: `StaticAura` (see
// transmutation/plant_growth.ron, itself flavored as "dense, choking
// overgrowth" -- an close match for Entangle) leaves a real aura entity
// behind at the caster's position that keeps reapplying its buff to anyone
// standing in it for `aura_duration`. The one real limitation `StaticAura`
// has (common/src/states/static_aura.rs): it always places the zone at the
// caster's OWN position (no aimed/targeted placement exists), so the
// sheet's 27 m cast range is not mechanically expressed -- the same
// simplification transmutation/plant_growth.ron (compendium range
// Meters(46.0)) and transmutation/control_winds_turbulence.ron (compendium
// range Meters(91.0)) already ship with despite their own sheets also
// describing a remote cast point.
StaticAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    energy_cost: 40.0,
    targets: OutOfGroup,
    auras: [
        (kind: Rooted, strength: 1.0, duration: Some(2), category: Some(Magical)),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(15.0),
    range: 6.0,
    sprite_info: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Primordial)),
)
